# textdomain: doggiowars
# Traditional Chinese translation of DoggioWars. English is the source language.

Aerial dogfight over floating voxel islands — you ARE the fighter plane. 12 island biomes, volcanoes and waterfalls, aerobatic tricks, destructible terrain and greyhound races after a golden rabbit. Keyboard + gamepad.=在漂浮的體素島嶼上空展開空戰——你就是那架戰鬥機。12 種島嶼生態域、火山與瀑布、特技飛行、可破壞地形，還有追逐金兔的靈緹賽跑。支援鍵盤和手把。
